sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant Admin
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PS as PayrollService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  S->>PS: 05:00 on the 1st, runMonthEndPayroll
  PS->>PG: load active locations
  PS->>PG: per assignment, base salary from the plan in force on the last day
  PS->>PG: lock unsettled commission entries up to month end
  PS->>PG: insert PENDING payroll record and PENDING settlement
  Admin->>Web: Payroll, pick the month
  Web->>API: GET /payroll
  API-->>Web: records with base, commission, total
  Admin->>Web: Generate Payroll, only if the job missed a location
  Web->>API: POST /payroll/generate
  API->>PS: generate, existing records are skipped
  Admin->>Web: Mark as Paid, method and reference
  Web->>API: PATCH /payroll/:id/mark-paid
  API->>PS: markPaid
  PS->>PG: record paid, settlement paid
  Admin->>API: GET /payroll/export and GET /payroll/:id/payslip-pdf - no button calls them
